  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Notes_Field: '- find POI - Spatialized sound: radar?


    -----------------------------

    -
    Environmental Hazards (1) - Spatial sound or Sensor warning (flat): EAS


    -
    Structural Hazards (1) - Spatial sound: geiger counter


    Dangerous areas:
    stairs, ledges (bridge), a simulated area with gas

    Find sound type

    Stairs
    can be simulated with a marker in the middle hole, keeping the same y-level as
    player. Activated when distance<5 or something. Same with ledges.


    ------------------------------------

    -
    Health Monitoring - non-Spatialized 3D sound: https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/vital-sign-sfx-164300/'
