  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1680382077}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d5624a4aa352f5340a04eccde932530c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Notes_Field: '- find POI - Spatialized sound: POI can be a target person, a target
    location, a resource location, an unsearched room(s), or a teammate location
    (if enabled). May also be uncategorized item.


    already implemented. Find
    alternative sound types


    -----------------------------

    - Environmental
    Hazards (1) - Spatial sound or Sensor warning (flat): An area may have fire hazard,
    gas leak, dangerous criminal, or other hazards that cover a general area. These
    can be marked with sounds (if known) or can warn the user if detected with on-board
    sensors.

    - Structural Hazards (1) - Spatial sound: An area may have unstable
    footing or unprotected ledges due to fire or inherently. These may be marked
    and warn the users to be careful around these local areas.


    Dangerous areas:
    stairs, ledges (bridge), a simulated area with gas

    Find sound type

    Stairs
    can be simulated with a marker in the middle hole, keeping the same y-level as
    player. Activated when distance<10 or something. Same with ledges.


    ------------------------------------

    -
    Health Monitoring - non-Spatialized 3D sound: The vitals of a person may need
    to be tracked from afar. Their pulse or other variables may need to be tracked.
    This may require an input to toggle on and off depending on the situation.


    Simulated
    target area where dummy will exist at location. Can be happening from the start
    or start at a scripted point when navigation.

    Find sound type'
